### bare variable in double brackets
[[ $DEBUG ]] && set -x
>>> none

### two adjacent expansions quoted together
[[ "$first$last" ]] && echo "has a name"
>>> none

### bare quoted variable in single brackets
[ "$api_key" ] || exit 1
>>> none

### empty quoted string
[ "" ] && echo "never"
>>> SC2078 1:3

### variable glued to equals one
[[ $verbose=1 ]] && echo "always true"
>>> SC2077 1:12
